      "\n",
      "Minimal activation duration :\n",
      "\n",
      "  Nuclear         : 4,764 h/year\n",
      "  Biomass         : 884 h/year\n",
      "  Oil             : 5 h/year\n",
      "  CCGT            : 485 h/year\n",
      "  OCGT            : 40 h/year\n",
