    "### D.2.3 - Political choices\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "459723b6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "As you have seen the power mix are for now technology neutral. If for political reason you do not want gas, oil or nuclear for instance, here is the place to add these constraints\n",
    "\n",
    "Note1: Similarly to what we did before with carbon emission redution targets, you will be able to get the shadow price of your political decisions\n",
    "\n",
    "Note2: We keep the carbon emmission target if you also want to use it jointly with the policial choices. By default we set it at 0. (the carbon reduction target uses 6.2.1 as a reference)\n",
    "\n",
    "Note3: The contraints on capapcities must be political, not for logistics or industrial reasons for now."
   ]
  },
